				)
			)
		)
		(property "Description" "Molex Mini-Fit Jr. 45586-series dual-row RIGHT-ANGLE header, 8 circuits (2x4), 4.20mm pitch + 5.50mm row spacing, two 3.0mm snap-in PCB-lock pegs in line with the outer pin columns. VERIFIED land from the Molex 455860005/455860105 sales-drawing ECAD export (TraceParts, 2026-06-06) -- supersedes the prior cec-derived 5569 land (wrong 5.5mm rows + oval pads). The keying/polarization is in the plastic, not the PCB pattern, so this land serves both the PCIe-keyed 45586-0005 (3rd-gen polarization) and the EPS12V-keyed sibling. Native orientation: pad1 at origin, pads 1-4 row1 (y0) / 5-8 row2 (y-4.2), pegs + body/mouth toward +y."
			(at 0 0 0)
			(layer "F.Fab")
			(hide yes)
			(uuid "74f76f39-759b-4af6-8175-cb42ccae7892")
			(effects
